Facsimile: +1 407 238 8050

**Speakers:** *Please contact the Planning Committee for hotel
information.*

For reservations, please contact your travel agent, or telephone
the hotel directly at +1 407 238 8000 (U.S. callers
may use +1 800 823 8300 instead).  **You must
mention that you are attending the "ApacheCon conference."**
All reservations must be received on or before 8 February 2000;
reservations received after this date are not guaranteed availability
of accommodations or the ApacheCon 2000 rate.

### Airport Shuttle Service

ApacheCon 2000 delegates are eligible for a discounted price on
shuttle transportation between the Caribe Royale and the airport.
The shuttle company is Mears Transportation, and delegates should
receive a discount coupon in the mail after registering.

### Hotel Facilities

The
[Caribe Royale Resort Suites and Villas](http://www.cariberoyale.com/)
is a modern hotel, built in 1996 and located
about 25 minutes from the Orlando airport.  There
are two styles of sleeping rooms available: suites (US$189-259/night)
and 'villas' (US$259/night).  All telephones are 'data-capable.'
The main hotel building includes a
gift shop, business centre, restaurant, and bar.

Checkin time is 3:00 PM EST.

Checkout time is 11:00 AM EST.

Early checkins will be accommodated when possible.  The hotel's
Guest Services will provide luggage storage facilities.

*These are special reduced rates for the ApacheCon 2000 conference.
They are available from three days before through three days following
the conference (5-13 March 2000).*

Suites are single-bedroom/single-bath accommodations, and include
a minibar and living area with chairs, tables, and a sleeper sofa.
There are telephones in the living area and in the bedroom.

Queen (Double)
$189.00

King (Standard)
$199.00

Deluxe (King)
$209.00

Executive Suite
$259.00

Villas include two separate bedrooms,
two separate baths, and a common living area and kitchen,
complete with stove, oven, refrigerator, and private laundry
facilities.  Each villa includes a screened balcony overlooking
the swimming pool or lake.  Both bedrooms
and the living area are equipped with televisions and telephones.
The price is the same *per* villa, regardless of occupancy;
each villa can accommodate up to 8 persons.

Villa (2BR, 2 bath, LR, kitchenette)
$259.00

### Convention Facilities

The convention centre is on the grounds of the Caribe Royale resort,
and is a brief (2 minute) walk from the hotel proper.  Opened in
1998, it is fully wired for Internet access, with connectivity provided
by multiple T1 leased lines, and provides state-of-the-art
audiovisual support.  There is a business centre in the same
building as the conference rooms.

