### Air Transportation

**Delta Airlines** is the official air carrier of ApacheCon 2000.
Delta is providing special rates and incentives for ApacheCon 2000
attendees.

Delta, Delta Express, the Delta Shuttle, the Delta Shuttle Carriers,
and Delta's Worldwide Partners operate in excess of 5,000 flights
each day to over 300 cities in more than 400 countries.  Internationally,
Delta is the leader across the North Atlantic, offering the most
daily flight departures, serving the largest number of nonstop
markets, and carrying the most passengers of any U.S. airline.

Delta's nationwide toll-free reservation number is staffed by
fully trained specialists who will assist you or your travel agent
in confirming reservations to ApacheCon 2000.  Delta will handle
every call, regardless of your departure city.

#### For travel originating *within* the U.S.

*Special ApacheCon 2000 meeting fare: call Delta Airlines at
+1 800 241 6760 and refer to file number*
**135889A**.

Delta Airlines is offering special rates which allow you a 5% discount
off Delta's published round-trip fares1
within the continental U.S., Hawaii, Alaska, Canada, Mexico,
Bermuda, San Juan, Nassau, and the U.S. Virgin Islands.  By purchasing
your ticket 60 days or more prior to your departure date, you can
receive an additional 5% bonus discount.

1 Applicable restrictions must
be met.  Seats are limited.  No discounts apply on Delta Express.

A 10% discount will be offered on Delta's
domestic system2 for travel
to ApacheCon 2000 based upon the published unrestricted round-trip
coach (Y06) rates.  No advance reservation or ticketing is required,
but if you purchase your ticket 60 days or more prior to your
departure date, you can receive an additional 5% bonus discount.

2 No discounts apply on Delta
Express.

Special round-trip Zone Fares are also available to all cities served
by Delta and Delta Express in the continental U.S., Hawaii, Alaska,
Mexico, Bermuda, San Juan, Nassau, and the U.S. Virgin Islands for
savings on midweek travel to ApacheCon 2000.  Two-day
minimum stay, no Saturday night stay required.  Only seven days advance
reservations and ticketing.  Fares are fully refundable, less
administrative service fee.  (Note: Zone fares are *not*
valid for travel to a destination served only by a Delta
Connection carrier.)

To take advantage of these discounts:

- Call (or have your travel agent call) **Delta Meeting Network
Reservations** at +1 800 241 6760, week-days
between 7:30 AM EST and 11:00 PM EST.  Refer to file number
**135889A**.

Travel in the continental U.S., Hawaii, Alaska, Canada, Mexico, Bermuda,
San Juan, Nassau, and the U.S. Virgin Islands only.  These discounts are
available *only* through the Delta Meeting Network Reservation
toll-free number.

#### For travel originating *outside* the U.S.

To make tour ApacheCon 2000 air travel arrangements with Delta
Airlines,

- Call (or have your travel agent call) your local **Delta Sales Office**.
- Refer to Delta Meeting Network file number **135889A**.

### Car Transportation

**Avis Rent A Car** has been selected as the official rental
car agency of ApacheCon 2000.  Avis is offering special reduced
rates for ApacheCon 2000 attendees.

For prices and reservations, please call the **Avis Meeting
Reservations and Information Desk** at +1 800 331 1600.
Please refer to Avis Worldwide Discount number **D130767**.
